  "term": "topiramate",
  "definition": "Topiramate is a pharmacologic substance with anticonvulsant effects. It appears to reduce seizures by blocking certain glutamate receptor activity, increasing GABA-related activity, and helping stabilize overexcited nerve cell signaling in the central nervous system.",
